Package: gitneighbr
Title: Git Help, from a Friendly Neighbor
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("John", "Prybylski", , "jprybylski@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A local, browser-based application that helps people who are
    unfamiliar with Git understand, save, and publish changes in an
    existing Git repository, while remaining a fast, scriptable
    convenience tool for experienced users. Exposes a small, safe subset
    of Git (status, commit, push, a single annotated tag, single-file
    restore, and 'gitignore' assistance) through a local plumber2 server
    and a precompiled browser UI, and refuses to automate anything that
    requires human judgment.
